   "text": "◈ THE AUDIT — the System reads your run back to you, and the galaxy listens. A lesser seat — regional standing, waves 1–3 faced (11/7/3), with 2 wave-4 fought, 9 contests survived, 2 crises weathered. The table does not rise. It prices."
