   "day": 90,
   "text": "◈ THE WAR PATH — The System pauses — actually pausing. It keeps a list of every tooth pulled, and for once it reads the list instead of the press release. THE HERALD came. Named and located — the war council knew its face. They faced The Suburb and lived to sit here. They faced Big Loud and lived to sit here. Even now the wave-4 bar reads: blood your fighters (0 of 1 veterans). Even now the wave-5 bar reads: armor the village (3 of 4 fighters armored); blood your fighters (0 of 2 veterans)."
